  {
    "index": 8,
    "id": "PBSwPBswvM6xz8GD",
    "texts": [
      {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "We had the pleasure of managing social media and creating engaging content for Food Scientist Brand, a popular food stall on CU CAMPUS. Our team crafted eye-catching visuals, developed a cohesive brand voice, and implemented strategic campaigns to boost engagement and attract more students. From mouthwatering posts to interactive stories, we helped elevate their online presence and drive foot traffic to the stall."
      }
